|~ The verbs of quotes [D62]. Each resides on `::qlang/quote`, the kind
   whose module declares it [D72]; a quote is also the vector of its
   steps, so the verbs of vectors read it as one. ~|

:parse
  |~~ The source text of the quote, the reverse of `parse` on a string.

      ~(~(add 1) | parse | eq "add 1")
  ~~|
  ::verb~(:returns ::string | ::builtin{:impl :qlang/prim/parse})
